ct fractions (\u001b[48;5;234m1.25\u001b[49m/\u001b[48;5;234m1.5\u001b[49m → \u001b[48;5;234m0.25\u001b[49m) to demonstrate. Say the word if\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252myou'd like the buy amount rounded for display; that's a separate change.\u001b[m\n\u001b[5G\u001b[38;5;103mWorking\u001b[38;5;243m checking\u001b[m\u001b[83X\u001b[38;66H\u001b[38;5;243m \u001b[m   \u001b[38;5;252m$0.08\u001b[38;5;243m · \u001b[38;5;252m⟲ saved $0.0309 · 90% cached\u001b[38;5;243m   \u001b[38;5;252m26.4k/1M · 3%\u001b[m   \n\u001b[4G\u001b[?25h"]
